<title>UK: UBS sets call warrants on itself.</title>
<headline>UBS sets call warrants on itself.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland said it has issued 50 million call warrants on bearer shares of itself.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 100 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1,900 CHF		 PREMIUM	22.4 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.64 CHF		  GEARING	10.3 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 11.JUL.97-19.MAR.99   PAYDATE	11.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS		     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  1,685 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
